 # UnderWeb X changelog
 
+## 0.4.3-rc3 — UWX chatbox signature
+
+- Added an optional UWX branding block to OSC Chatbox Composer.
+- Added Off, Short (🕷 UWX), and Full (UNDERWEB X) signature styles.
+- Default signature style is Short so UWX is visible without wasting the 144-character budget.
+
 ## 0.4.2-rc2 — OSC live status upgrade
 
 - Added continuous chatbox keep-alive output while OSC is armed.
